title: IntroCall2Part1
---
Samantha: Me and the boys are ready near the bank, how 'bout you? #line:intro-sam-06
Lucas: Same here. #line:intro-luc-06 
Samantha: Good, we're going in. Engine is gonna plug you into the mainframe. #line:intro-sam-07 
Samantha: And, you're good to go. The doors in the back are remotely controlled. You can access them through the security chief's computer. #line:intro-sam-08
Lucas: Give me a sec. #line:intro-luc-07
===

title: IntroCall2Part2
---
Lucas: Found it! It's password-protected. #line:intro-luc-08
Samantha: That was expectable, you still know how to do it right? You mentioned finding the code, then you have to decompress it, right? And decode, I guess? #line:intro-sam-09
Lucas: You're kinda right actually, also I have my guidebook ready just in case. #line:intro-luc-09
Samantha: Good, go get it for us. #line:intro-sam-10
===

title: IntroCall2Part3
---
Lucas: Okay, I got the password. All I need is to type it in and open the damn doors. #line:intro-luc-10
Samantha: I knew you had it! #line:intro-sam-11
===

title: IntroCall2Part4
---
Lucas: Doors should be open by now. #line:intro-luc-11
Samantha: Yes indeed. *Laughing* All the money, just for us. #line:intro-sam-12
Lucas: Ey! Don't forget about that 25% for the client. #line:intro-luc-12
Samantha: Yeah Mr Dawdler and Fun-killer, I remember! #line:intro-sam-13
===

title: IntroCall2Part5
---
Unknown: Get down on the ground! Now! #line:intro-unknown-01
Samantha: Lucas, run! #line:intro-sam-14
===
